 video for “Sky Blue Skin,” featuring elements from the newly released book Jeff Buckley: His Own Voice, available now from Hachette Books - http://bit.ly/Buckley-Book\n\nFollow Jeff Buckley:\nFacebook: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/follow_FI\nInstagram: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/follow_II\nTwitter: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/follow_TI\nWebsite: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/follow_WI\nSpotify: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/follow_SI\nYouTube: https://JeffBuckley.lnk.to/subscribe_YD\n\nLyrics:\n\nWell I heard there was a secret chord\nThat David played and it pleased the Lord\nBut you don't really care for music, do you?\nWell it goes like this:\nThe fourth, the fifth, the minor fall and the major lift\nThe baffled king composing Hallelujah\n\nHallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah, Hallelujah...\n\nWell your faith was strong but you needed proof\nYou saw her bathing on the roof\nHer beauty and the moonlight overthrew ya\nShe tied you toher kitchen chair\nShe broke your throne and she cut your hair\nAnd from your lips she drew the Hallelujah\n\n#JeffBuckley #Hallelujah #OfficialMusicVideo", "channel_id": "UCTzzsUZ0AWCmNhLmdpHmuTw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTzzsUZ0AWCmNhLmdpHmuTw", "duration": 394, "view_count": 248492229, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y8AWFf7EAc4", "categories": ["Music"], "tags": ["jeff buckley", "hallelujah", "lover you should've come over", "live at gleneagles", "jeff buckley lover you should've come over", "lover you should've come over live at gleneagles", "mojo pin", "grace", "just like woman", "know its over", "lialic wine", "last goodbye", "everyday people", "so real", "nightmare by the sea", "songs", "live"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en": [{"url": "https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timed